<title>UK: SBNSW sets A$100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>SBNSW sets A$100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATE BANK OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  GOVERNMENT OF THE STATE OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.0 PCT   MATURITY    19.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.70    PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY     *AAA	 LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	 *AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIP     0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		*GUARANTOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
